    # 1.0.3 review MEDIUM: harmless tools a person's normal use needs. Enter plan mode (only narrows the session); the
    # to-do and task lists (Claude Code's own list state, at a path it fixes; no path, file or command from the model);
    # read a background task's output; list MCP resources. Left out on purpose: ExitPlanMode (saves the model's plan
    # text to a plan file and changes the permission mode), Skill (a skill's !`command` lines run a shell command when
    # it loads, outside this hook) and ReadMcpResourceTool (saves a binary resource to a file on disk, from any server).
    "EnterPlanMode", "TodoWrite", "TaskCreate", "TaskUpdate", "TaskList", "TaskGet", "TaskOutput",
    "ListMcpResourcesTool",
))
CLEAN_COMMAND_TOOLS = ("Bash", "Monitor")  # the shell tools the check below understands (PowerShell is another shell)
